"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4033217,"text":"「黄金屋」を出た時に「群玉閣」を見てなかったら、どこに行けばいいか分からなかったな…","nextNodeIds":[10240203]},{"nodeId":10240203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":226078713,"text":"間に合ったよな？「渦の魔神」はまだ璃月港に上陸してないよな？","nextNodeIds":[10240204]},{"nodeId":10240204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":4273043145,"text":"お前たち…なぜここに。","nextNodeIds":[10240205]},{"nodeId":10240205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":594275457,"text":"ん？…あっ、仙人たちだ！どうして「群玉閣」にいるんだ？七星と喧嘩したって聞いたけど…もう解決したのか？","nextNodeIds":[10240206]},{"nodeId":10240206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":1224927977,"text":"互いの不満は一旦置いておいて、今は共に璃月を守るべきだと、そうなったのよ。","nextNodeIds":[10240207]},{"nodeId":10240207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10286,"speakerName":"削月築陽真君","textMapHash":925460249,"text":"フン。","nextNodeIds":[10240208]},{"nodeId":10240208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4063022977,"text":"なるほどな。じゃあ、何か案があるんだな？","nextNodeIds":[10240209]},{"nodeId":10240209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":170895561,"text":"ううっ…こんなにも距離が離れてるのに、あの「渦の魔神」をチラッと見ただけで息が詰まりそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[10240210]},{"nodeId":10240210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1016,"speakerName":"刻晴","textMapHash":2829937913,"text":"千岩軍の新兵たちは、立ち上がることすらできないわ。上古魔神の威圧は、一般人にとって有害なようね。","nextNodeIds":[10240211]},{"nodeId":10240211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1016,"speakerName":"刻晴","textMapHash":1156026385,"text":"——だからこそ、あの化け物を璃月港に近づけさせるわけにはいかない！","nextNodeIds":[10240212]},{"nodeId":10240212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3544794329,"text":"怖い…2000年前の魔神戦争は、こんな敵と戦ってたのか…","nextNodeIds":[10240213]},{"nodeId":10240213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":4120296649,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[10240214]},{"nodeId":10240214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1608711929,"text":"今ここにいる七星、千岩軍、それと仙人たちの力を合わせれば、あの魔神を倒せそうか？","nextNodeIds":[10240215]},{"nodeId":10240215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":4205043465,"text":"話し合ったけど、それは…分からないわ。","nextNodeIds":[10240216]},{"nodeId":10240216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3326458241,"text":"うそだろ！？…で、でも、璃月を守る仙人と七星だろ！何か方法はないのか？","nextNodeIds":[10240217]},{"nodeId":10240217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10285,"speakerName":"留雲借風真君","textMapHash":1448063137,"text":"方法はある。","nextNodeIds":[10240218]},{"nodeId":10240218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3066519809,"text":"えっ？","nextNodeIds":[10240219]},{"nodeId":10240219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10285,"speakerName":"留雲借風真君","textMapHash":2225030633,"text":"「帰終機」の件で、七星を悩ませたようだな。","nextNodeIds":[10240220]},{"nodeId":10240220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10285,"speakerName":"留雲借風真君","textMapHash":4181553945,"text":"せっかく「帰終機」を作った妾がこの場にいるのだ…","nextNodeIds":[10240221]},{"nodeId":10240221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10285,"speakerName":"留雲借風真君","textMapHash":1978507649,"text":"仙人の装置、凡人には分かるまい。だが妾が少し手を加えれば、想像を超える改良も容易いこと。","nextNodeIds":[10240222]},{"nodeId":10240222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":3736675977,"text":"ふふっ…これも「仙人との縁」かしら。","nextNodeIds":[10240223]},{"nodeId":10240223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":718489849,"text":"ここにいる仙人たちも、装置に仙力を注ぐことができるはずだし、これで「新帰終機」で魔神と戦えるわ。","nextNodeIds":[10240224]},{"nodeId":10240224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":51559729,"text":"善は急げ、今が決戦の時よ——作戦開始！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[102402,0],"PAINLIBBL